CM_ BU_ ICD "Isabellenhuette ISAscale ICD shunt current sensor (datasheet v1.3)";
CM_ BU_ Data_Station "RPi 5 CAN Shield";
CM_ BO_ 48 "AQT2 Repeater";
CM_ BO_ 1921 "16x12 thermal matrix, block 1/24. Row-major: 16 columns x 12 rows, zero-based row 0, columns 0..7. T_degC = raw + 30. Send all blocks from one frozen acquisition in ascending order; no acquisition counter in payload.";
CM_ BO_ 1922 "16x12 thermal matrix, block 2/24. Row-major: 16 columns x 12 rows, zero-based row 0, columns 8..15. T_degC = raw + 30. Send all blocks from one frozen acquisition in ascending order; no acquisition counter in payload.";
